## Deploy
1. `git status` first — script uploads the **working tree** (other sessions’ dirty files go live too).
2. Static: `.\deploy-to-guide.ps1 -ServerIP "18.207.55.50"` → `/opt/bitnami/wordpress/guide`
3. Worker: `.\deploy-worker.ps1` (unsets the wrong-account `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN`; OAuth = jeybeeicon). Do not run bare `npx wrangler deploy` while that env var is set.
4. After JS/CSS: bump `?v=N` and `sw.js` `CACHE` (`kp-v70` now).
5. Skip a full tar for one-file fixes if packing stalls; don’t overlap another vertical’s upload.
